sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as Layer2LedgerAPIHandler
    participant Redis
    participant DBWriter as Layer2LedgerDbWriter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Bridge as Layer2Bridge
    participant Layer1Network as Layer 1 Network

    Note over User, Layer1Network: Step 1: RequestWithdrawal
    User->>API: POST /RequestWithdrawal (RequestWithdrawalRequest)
    activate API
    
    API->>API: Validate addresses & amount (> 0, < MINIMUM_LAYER1_TRANSACTION_AMOUNT)
    API->>API: Verify signature from source address
    API->>Redis: Check if source address is locked
    API->>DB: Check layer2_transaction_id uniqueness
    
    alt Validation Failed
        API-->>User: HTTP Error (e.g., "Invalid request", "Address locked")
    else Validation Success
        API->>Redis: Lock source address
        API->>API: Generate Layer2 Transaction (subtract withdrawal amount)
        API->>API: Create WithdrawalRequest (status: WITHDRAWAL_STATUS_PENDING)
        API->>Redis: Push RedisPendingWithdrawal to PendingWithdrawals list
        API-->>User: Success "Withdrawal request created"
    end
    deactivate API

    Note over DBWriter, DB: Background Processing
    loop DB Writing Process
        DBWriter->>Redis: Fetch RedisPendingWithdrawal from PendingWithdrawals
        activate DBWriter
        DBWriter->>DB: Insert Layer2 Transaction & WithdrawalRequest
        DBWriter->>Redis: Release source address lock
        DBWriter->>Redis: Remove from PendingWithdrawals list
        deactivate DBWriter
    end

    Note over Bridge, Layer1Network: Step 2: WithdrawalBroadcasted
    Bridge->>API: POST /GetWithdrawalRequests
    API->>DB: Fetch pending WithdrawalRequests
    DB-->>API: Return pending withdrawals
    API->>API: Update status to WITHDRAWAL_STATUS_ACKNOWLEDGED
    API-->>Bridge: Return withdrawal requests
    
    Bridge->>Layer1Network: Process withdrawals & transfer L1 funds
    Layer1Network-->>Bridge: L1 transaction created
    
    Bridge->>API: POST /WithdrawalBroadcasted (WithdrawalBroadcastedRequest)
    API->>API: Verify signature from Layer2Ledger
    API->>DB: Update WithdrawalRequest status to WITHDRAWAL_STATUS_BROADCASTED
    API->>DB: Create ConfirmedWithdrawal (confirmed: False)
    API-->>Bridge: Success "Withdrawal broadcasted"

    Note over Bridge, Layer1Network: Step 3: WithdrawalConfirmed
    Bridge->>Layer1Network: Monitor L1 transaction confirmations
    Layer1Network-->>Bridge: Transaction has required confirmations
    
    Bridge->>API: POST /WithdrawalConfirmed (WithdrawalConfirmedRequest)
    API->>API: Verify signature from Layer2Ledger
    API->>DB: Update ConfirmedWithdrawal (confirmed: True)
    API-->>Bridge: Success "Withdrawal confirmed"
